(text "INPUTS 9-12: PASSIVE SENSING AND ADC" (at 20 18 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid 5e066607-4065-5658-9964-9c25dcd82813))
(text "J1-J3: wire openings face lower board edge.\nContact 1 is at right; input labels still increase left-to-right." (at 25 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 3b9803f1-b237-5a56-bff8-6aba8412374d))
(text "Two 1M resistors limit input current.\n4.7k returns each ADC input to passive VBIAS.\nNo analog switch or active input clamp.\nInput attenuation also applies without USB power." (at 25 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 0824d358-dc5e-54f6-8cec-5b31ee4bacff))
(text "470pF filters are on the ADC side.\nNominal attenuation = 426.5319. PGA = +/-1.024V.\nOne common supply; multiple + / return / open pins." (at 230 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 5b7cc11d-72e6-501d-b59a-bdac8dd34cb3))
(text "12V nominal; 0-18V intended measurement range.\n48V is a calculation stress, not a survival rating.\nDo not connect any terminal directly to AGND or USB_GND." (at 25 242 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid 5ba72095-548a-5e6f-80e9-0c46a32469ab))
)
